      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. i actually had a tetanus shot like... many years ago, i think? i dont remember exactly when but it wasnt that long ago. since the wound isnt that big and i cleaned it already, do u think i really need to go in for a shot? i'm mostly just worried about it getting infected, and the peroxide seems pretty strong so that should handle everything right?",
